-- A ditto in a clause head (probe q/dit5): printed from the source text,
-- it resolved against the printer's line, and swapped `f TRUE` and
-- `f FALSE` under `l4 batch`.

GIVETH A BOOLEAN
k MEANS FALSE OR
  TRUE
f ^    MEANS 1
f b    MEANS 2

@export default g
GIVEN b IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
g b MEANS f b

